OL,3,GNEWSAUnderused garage sites could
OL,4,Abecome new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Sussex council is due to decide
OL,7,Fon plans to build 22 affordable homes
OL,8,Fon underused garage sites.
OL,10,FOn Wednesday, the Horsham District
OL,11,FCouncil's cabinet will vote on whether
OL,12,Fto approve a development which would
OL,13,Fprovide one, two and three-bedroom
OL,14,Fhomes to those on the housing register.
OL,16,FBelinda Walters, cabinet member for
OL,17,Fhousing and communities, said the
OL,18,Fproposal would provide new homes "while
OL,19,Fturning underused garage sites into
OL,20,Fwelcoming places to live".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
